---
description: Documentation and release notes rules
globs:
  - "README.md"
  - "docs/**/*.md"
  - ".github/**/*.md"
alwaysApply: false
---

Prefer:
- documentation updates aligned with real code changes and current compatibility ranges
- concise, actionable entries under `## [Unreleased]` in `docs/CHANGELOG.md`
- updating `docs/UPGRADING.md` together with the CHANGELOG when host applications are affected
- `docs/CONFIGURATION.md` for every `nowo_wallet_qr` key, `docs/SECURITY.md` for secrets/logging changes, `docs/PSR.md` when PSR usage changes
- GitHub links with the repository slug `nowo-tech/WalletQRBundle`; Packagist / Composer names stay `nowo-tech/wallet-qr-bundle`
- keeping examples consistent with actual defaults in `src/DependencyInjection/Configuration.php`

Releases follow `docs/RELEASE.md` (`make release-check` first).

Do not invent features, versions, or commands that are not present in the repository.
Do not remove past release history unless explicitly requested.
